        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/foreign-workers/labour-market-impact-assessment-processing-times.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">LMIA application processing times (updated November 12, 2026), ESDC</a></li>
