        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/foreign-workers/median-wage.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Wage thresholds for high-wage and low-wage positions, ESDC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/foreign-workers/refusal.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Refusal to process a Labour Market Impact Assessment application (CMA unemployment rates), ESDC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/services/foreign-workers/global-talent.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Global Talent Stream service standard, ESDC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/employment-social-development/news/2026/11/government-of-canada-announces-targeted-reforms-to-the-temporary-foreign-worker-program-to-respond-to-labour-market-needs.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Targeted reforms to the Temporary Foreign Worker Program (November 6, 2026), ESDC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/express-entry/documents/job-offer.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Express Entry: Job offer, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/express-entry/changes.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">2026 changes to points for Canadian work experience and job offers in Express Entry, IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/for-employers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP information for employers, WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/bc-pnp-si-program-guide-pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP Skills Immigration Program Guide, WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.cicnews.com/2026/11/lmia-wait-times-track-higher-1182479.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">LMIA wait times track higher (November 12, 2026), CIC News (September comparison)</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">Information current as of November 15, 2026. Processing times change monthly; confirm on ESDC's page before relying on them.</p>

    </div>

